1
00:00:00,856 --> 00:00:02,316
(Leonard:)She doesn't like you.

2
00:00:03,317 --> 00:00:05,737
- Well, you have a gall bladder to remove.
- Yeah.

3
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:09,363
(Leonard:)And I have to get in the shower
and Penny has clothes to put on, so...

4
00:00:10,699 --> 00:00:14,079
- Well, it was very nice meeting you.
- Nice to finally meet you too.

5
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:16,954
- I'll see you tonight? Bye.
- Yeah. Bye-bye.

6
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:29,798
(Sheldon:)What could I possibly have done to offend
Mrs. Vartabedian?

7
00:00:30,844 --> 00:00:33,844
(Penny:)So that's Stephanie, huh?

8
00:00:35,557 --> 00:00:38,847
(Leonard:)Why do I feel like I'm the one
that just got the prostate exam?

9
00:00:44,525 --> 00:00:47,865
- You know, she seems very nice.
- Oh, she is. She's terrific.

10
00:00:48,028 --> 00:00:50,238
(Sheldon:)And she's proving to be
a valuable roommate.

11
00:00:50,697 --> 00:00:54,747
- Roommate? You guys are living together?
- Like hippies.

12
00:00:55,285 --> 00:00:56,785
(Leonard:)We're not living together.

13
00:00:56,954 --> 00:00:59,414
(Sheldon:)Do I have to pull out
the paperwork again?

